  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Women&apos;s Empowerment II - UNDP Women Entrepreneurship II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP Women&apos;s Empowerment II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med projektet &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja kvinnors f&#xf6;retagande i syd&#xf6;stra    Anatolien genom &#xf6;kad produktion och marknadsf&#xf6;ringsf&#xe4;rdigheter f&#xf6;r    att generera inkomster och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra deras levnadsstandard. UNDP &#xe4;r   avtalspart och GAP Administrationen implementerare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim with the project is that Women&#xb4;s enterprises in Southeast     Anatolia have production and marketing skills to generate incomes and improve their life standard. UNDP is the agreement partner and GAP    Administration the implementer.</narrative>
  </description>
